&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity where we are looking for a Commercial Finance Manager to become part of the&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;UK Commercial team, reporting to the Commercial Business Partner. This is a key role, with an overriding objective to partner with the Commercial Business Partner and the business, whilst fostering a growth mindset to help drive KPI’s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide commercial insight and performance analysis across WPP Media Solutions, supporting strategic decision-making and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of commercial and financial models for new solutions, and client opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support key stakeholders in driving client adoption of Solutions and increasing share of wallet across our client base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Revenue Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and monitor sales pipeline through Salesforce, including targeting and revenue tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse pipeline conversion trends and develop models to improve revenue predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with commercial teams to validate assumptions, identify risks and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support FP&amp;amp;A on revenue and net sales assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Margin &amp;amp; Profitability Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver analysis on net sales performance and client profitability across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key commercial trends and provide actionable insights to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve discrepancies within revenue and sales reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing, Trading &amp;amp; Commercial Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and implementation of pricing strategies across clients and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor delivery against commercial value agreements and trading commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse the impact of pricing, value delivery, and cost changes on net sales margins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Governance &amp;amp; Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct commercial due diligence for new client opt-in requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor net sales performance against bonus and incentive targets (QPP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key link between Commercial and Finance teams, ensuring commercial terms and charging methodologies are accurately applied across all revenue streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ad hoc commercial analysis and strategic support to relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and educate wider agency teams on commercial finance processes, principles, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified accountant or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years plus of industry Commercial / Financial experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity for multi-tasking and meeting multiple simultaneous deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High levels of gravitas with strong interpersonal skills, ability to communicate well, build trust and engender strong relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and attention to detail:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logical, concise and proficient at breaking down challenges into component parts and developing solutions-based responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forward thinking and a detailed planner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural attention to detail and ability to digest information from a wide variety of sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-minded, adept at developing/ assessing different options and solutions and adopting a helicopter view when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills with the ability to prioritise tasks and meet deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive approach, a logical and analytical thought process, with good attention to detail and high level of accuracy in their output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and to tight timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient with Excel (Advanced excel skills)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure is seeking a Senior Content Writer with strong enterprise infrastructure expertise to join the Global Value Management team.&amp;nbsp;This role is responsible for developing high-quality, reusable, modular written content that enables the creation of compelling, enterprise-grade value propositions, proactive proposals and supporting technical, operational and commercial documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will apply your understanding of enterprise infrastructure architectures to synthesize complex technical, operational and commercial inputs from Product, Engineering, Value Consultants, Competitive Intelligence, CX, Partners and Sales into clear, structured customer narratives that articulate the business value of Pure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the primary content writer within the team, you will help create and maintain the global master content library that underpins scalable proposal creation. You will enforce written content standards, ensuring outputs are governed, reusable and aligned to established messaging and quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Maintain Reusable Content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own writing of defined technical, operational and financial value levers for Pure solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable modular components at multiple levels of detail (executive summary, standard narrative, detailed technical content).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create persona and industry aware variations of core narrative where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consume and adapt existing Pure content (case studies, product documentation, analyst endorsements, services materials) for structured proposal use.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and evolve global master content in alignment with roadmap priorities and release cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical and Value Writing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical, operational and financial inputs into clear value narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compile and synthesize inputs from cross-functional SMEs into customer-ready outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently engage SMEs to validate accuracy and secure approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance technical credibility with executive-level clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proposal Content Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop best practice placeholder content for: Value propositions, Proactive proposals and Technical/operational/commercial Appendices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure content demonstrates strong narrative flow, clarity and business value articulation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Select Engagements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in select live proposal engagements to refine standards and identify reusable content opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute written content for strategic proactive proposals where required.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co own content standards &amp;amp; contribute to QA processes and structured release management for written content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear stakeholder communication and approval protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all outputs adhere to messaging, quality and governance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Technical Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of enterprise infrastructure technologies, with demonstrated experience writing about one or more of the following domains: (Enterprise storage (block, file, object), Compute and virtualization platforms, Hybrid cloud architectures, Data center, Infrastructure operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to confidently engage technical SMEs and interpret architectural and operational concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience synthesizing financial concepts into simple narrative form (taking input from SME’s not expected to have financial experience).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating multi solution portfolios and articulating integrated solution value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Writing Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written English skills, with the ability to produce precise, polished, executive ready content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience writing technical, solution or value-based content in an enterprise IT environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate complex technical, operational and commercial inputs into clear, customer facing narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building reusable, modular content or structured proposal components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive writing skills, including development of compelling summaries and structured appendices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work cross functionally with Product, Sales, Marketing, Engineering and Services teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience independently driving SME engagement, review cycles and approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong version control, content lifecycle and revision management discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise sales or value selling motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with proposal development and business case articulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to modular content systems or AI enabled content tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in global organizations with standardized messaging frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
